--- !u!114 &1979995015
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1979995012}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 6b23cc00a9b25d34093f5acd3fccb1f0, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: '::'
  subtitleTextUI: {fileID: 529319114}
  subtitleBackgroundObject: {fileID: 1763700943}
  audioSourcesToMonitor:
  - {fileID: 345315389}
  - {fileID: 2125179461}
  - {fileID: 949465678}
  - {fileID: 1238971889}
  - {fileID: 1626761000}
  - {fileID: 748251846}
  - {fileID: 1158748526}
  - {fileID: 1037208196}
  - {fileID: 575842565}
  subtitles:
  - subtitleName: Intro
    clipToListenFor: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a69bb94d260d50c4c98982777773126c, type: 3}
    subtitleChunks:
    - text: Hi! You are new here, right? I am Maria.
      startTime: 0
      duration: 5
    - text: Enjoy your cafe.
      startTime: 5.5
      duration: 2.5
    frenchClipToListenFor: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f20b563c75f6309408578ef4a5fedd94, type: 3}
    frenchSubtitleChunks:
    - text: "Hey ! Vous \xEAtes nouveau ici, non ? Moi, c'est Sonia."
      startTime: 0
      duration: 6
    - text: "Profitez bien de votre caf\xE9."
      startTime: 6.5
      duration: 2.5
  - subtitleName: OhNo
    clipToListenFor: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e90be1e5224441741a56a65e64beb9bf, type: 3}
    subtitleChunks:
    - text: Oh, no worries ... we'll fix it.
      startTime: 0
      duration: 2.5
    frenchClipToListenFor: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 40ccac16c5e01f24a87fe9377b415d49, type: 3}
    frenchSubtitleChunks:
    - text: "Oh, mais \xE7a c'est pas gr\xE2ve, pas de soucis... on va le r\xE9parer."
      startTime: 0
      duration: 4
  - subtitleName: Story1
    clipToListenFor: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ed3e2c91d937f434e823bbc778e5288f, type: 3}
    subtitleChunks:
    - text: I left Barny the Frog by accident.
      startTime: 0
      duration: 3
    - text: I was maybe ... six or seven,
      startTime: 3
      duration: 3
    - text: "and I really didn\u2019t want to go to school."
      startTime: 6
      duration: 3
    - text: Every morning, Mum would bring me here first for a hot chocolate.
      startTime: 9
      duration: 4
    - text: That was kind of our deal.
      startTime: 13
      duration: 2
    - text: "I took Barny everywhere. One day, I must have just\u2026 forgotten it."
      startTime: 15.5
      duration: 7
    - text: Maria put it on the shelf with a tiny paper cup next to it.
      startTime: 22.5
      duration: 4
    - text: "She said something like, \u201CHe stayed for lunch.\u201D"
      startTime: 26
      duration: 3
    frenchClipToListenFor: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0951fc134ad1f0342b24d0716c0d922e, type: 3}
    frenchSubtitleChunks:
    - text: "J'ai oubli\xE9 Barny la grenouille ici par accident."
      startTime: 0
      duration: 3
    - text: J'avais ... six ou sept ans,
      startTime: 4
      duration: 2
    - text: "et je n'avais vraiment pas envie d'aller \xE0 l'\xE9cole."
      startTime: 6
      duration: 3
    - text: Chaque matin, ma Maman m'emmenait ici pour un chocolat chaud.
      startTime: 9
      duration: 4
    - text: "C'\xE9tait un peu notre rituel."
      startTime: 13
      duration: 2
    - text: "J'amenais Barny partout avec moi. Un jour, j'ai d\xFB tout simplement...
        l'oublier."
      startTime: 15.5
      duration: 5
    - text: "Sonia l'a pos\xE9 sur l'\xE9tag\xE8re"
      startTime: 20.5
      duration: 2
    - text: "et a dit : \xAB Il est rest\xE9 pour le d\xE9jeuner. \xBB"
      startTime: 22
      duration: 3
  - subtitleName: Story2
    clipToListenFor: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 76a881b73a68cfd4ab8d02895b0f0e5a, type: 3}
    subtitleChunks:
    - text: "I\u2019m not really a caf\xE9 person. Never was."
      startTime: 0
      duration: 3
    - text: My colleagues and I started coming.
      startTime: 3
      duration: 2
    - text: We had a construction site down the street.
      startTime: 5.5
      duration: 2.5
    - text: "Someone said this place didn\u2019t mind work boots."
      startTime: 8
      duration: 3
    - text: "I just ordered a Coke. Maria put the bottle down and said, \u201CYou\u2019ll
        want a glass.\u201D"
      startTime: 11
      duration: 5.5
    - text: We kept coming back. Lunch breaks, mostly.
      startTime: 17
      duration: 3
    - text: She stopped asking what we wanted.
      startTime: 20
      duration: 2
    - text: One afternoon, I left the empty bottle.
      startTime: 22.5
      duration: 3
    - text: "Maria put it on the shelf and said. \u201CSo I remember your first order.\u201D"
      startTime: 25
      duration: 4
    - text: "It\u2019s still the same."
      startTime: 29
      duration: 3.5
    frenchClipToListenFor: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b8dc1c687072ef046bc6e87703d56e01, type: 3}
    frenchSubtitleChunks:
    - text: "Je ne suis pas vraiment une personne \xE0 aimer le caf\xE9. Je ne l'ai
        jamais \xE9t\xE9."
      startTime: 0
      duration: 6
    - text: "Mes coll\xE8gues et moi, on a commenc\xE9 \xE0 venir"
      startTime: 6
      duration: 2
    - text: parce qu'on avait un chantier juste en bas de la rue.
      startTime: 7
      duration: 4
    - text: On m'a dit que cet endroit n'avait rien contre les chaussures de travail.
      startTime: 12
      duration: 3
    - text: "J'ai juste command\xE9 un Coca."
      startTime: 16
      duration: 2
    - text: "Sonia a pos\xE9 la bouteille sur la table et elle m'a dit : \xAB Vous
        voulez un verre ? \xBB"
      startTime: 18
      duration: 5
    - text: "On a continu\xE9 \xE0 revenir. Surtout pour les pauses d\xE9jeuner."
      startTime: 25
      duration: 6
    - text: Elle a fini par ne plus nous demander ce qu'on voulait.
      startTime: 32
      duration: 4
    - text: "Un apr\xE8s-midi, j'ai laiss\xE9 la bouteille vide."
      startTime: 35
      duration: 3
    - text: "Sonia l'a pos\xE9e sur l'\xE9tag\xE8re et a dit : \xAB Pour que je me
        souvienne de ta premi\xE8re commande. \xBB"
      startTime: 38
      duration: 5
    - text: "D\xE9sormais, c'est toujours pareil"
      startTime: 44
      duration: 2
  - subtitleName: Story3
    clipToListenFor: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6127752d38ab96244bc5900b747ee5bf, type: 3}
    subtitleChunks:
    - text: "This plate\u2026"
      startTime: 0
      duration: 1.5
    - text: "that\u2019s ours. Mine and Lotte\u2019s."
      startTime: 1.5
      duration: 3
    - text: "We come here every morning, like\u2026 eight o\u2019clock."
      startTime: 4.5
      duration: 4
    - text: Same table. Two coffees, two croissants.
      startTime: 8.5
      duration: 4
    - text: "We always end up ordering the second coffee before we\u2019ve finished
        the first."
      startTime: 12
      duration: 6
    - text: Maria still laughs at us.
      startTime: 18
      duration: 2
    - text: "One morning, Lotte didn\u2019t show up. Maria didn\u2019t ask."
      startTime: 20
      duration: 4
    - text: "She just put another croissant on the plate and said, \u201CIn case
        she\u2019s late.\u201D"
      startTime: 24.5
      duration: 6
    - text: Next day, Maria brought the same plate.
      startTime: 30
      duration: 3
    - text: She's used it for us ever since.
      startTime: 33
      duration: 2.5
    frenchClipToListenFor: {fileID: 8300000, guid: dc90cf9725302204a9c9fd14e8947686, type: 3}
    frenchSubtitleChunks:
    - text: Cette assiette...
      startTime: 0
      duration: 1
    - text: "c'est la n\xF4tre. La mienne et celle de Lotte."
      startTime: 1
      duration: 3
    - text: On vient ici tous les matins, vers... huit heures.
      startTime: 5
      duration: 3
    - text: "M\xEAme table. Deux caf\xE9s et deux croissants."
      startTime: 8
      duration: 4
    - text: "On finit toujours par commander le deuxi\xE8me caf\xE9 avant d'avoir
        termin\xE9 le premier."
      startTime: 12
      duration: 6
    - text: Sonia rigole encore de nous.
      startTime: 18
      duration: 3
    - text: "Un matin, Lotte n'est pas venue. Sonia n'a pas pos\xE9 de questions."
      startTime: 21
      duration: 6
    - text: "Elle a juste mis un autre croissant dans l'assiette et a dit : \xAB
        Au cas o\xF9 elle serait en retard. \xBB"
      startTime: 27
      duration: 7
    - text: "Le lendemain, Sonia a apport\xE9 la m\xEAme assiette."
      startTime: 34
      duration: 4
    - text: "Elle l'utilise pour nous depuis ce jour-l\xE0."
      startTime: 38
      duration: 3.5
  - subtitleName: Story4
    clipToListenFor: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f70dc5aa17cef454482303f124cc2075, type: 3}
    subtitleChunks:
    - text: "Every year on Saint Patrick\u2019s Day, Maria does this thing\u2026"
      startTime: 0
      duration: 4
    - text: 'she turns all the drinks green: Coffee, hot chocolate, lemonade.'
      startTime: 4.5
      duration: 5
    - text: One year, she even did green milk.
      startTime: 9.5
      duration: 3
    - text: The first time I saw it, it looked like a science experiment.
      startTime: 12
      duration: 4
    - text: We argued about which shade of green was best, as if that actually mattered.
      startTime: 16.5
      duration: 5
    - text: "I still don\u2019t know if makes it taste better."
      startTime: 22
      duration: 3
    - text: "But Maria does it anyway\u2026"
      startTime: 25
      duration: 2
    - text: Somehow, it became a tradition.
      startTime: 27
      duration: 2.5
    frenchClipToListenFor: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 442cf8580934fcc49bcb6e86abd02f9a, type: 3}
    frenchSubtitleChunks:
    - text: "\xC9tant irlandais d'origine, j'appr\xE9cie que"
      startTime: 0
      duration: 3
    - text: "chaque ann\xE9e pour la Saint-Patrick, Sonia fait cette chose..."
      startTime: 3
      duration: 4
    - text: "elle colore toutes les boissons en vert : le caf\xE9, le chocolat chaud,
        la limonade."
      startTime: 7
      duration: 5
    - text: "Une ann\xE9e, elle a m\xEAme fait du lait vert."
      startTime: 12.5
      duration: 2
    - text: "La premi\xE8re fois que j'ai vu \xE7a, on aurait cru \xE0 une exp\xE9rience
        scientifique."
      startTime: 17
      duration: 5
    - text: "On s'est disput\xE9s pour savoir quelle nuance de vert \xE9tait la meilleure,"
      startTime: 24
      duration: 3
    - text: " comme si \xE7a avait vraiment de l'importance."
      startTime: 27
      duration: 3
    - text: "Je ne sais toujours pas si \xE7a lui donne un meilleur go\xFBt."
      startTime: 30
      duration: 4
    - text: "Mais Sonia le fait quand m\xEAme..."
      startTime: 34
      duration: 2
    - text: "D'une fa\xE7on ou d'une autre, c'est devenu une tradition."
      startTime: 37
      duration: 3.5
  - subtitleName: Story5
    clipToListenFor: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d1dd0c751c78d934e9f65327cffeb88f, type: 3}
    subtitleChunks:
    - text: "That\u2019s mine or\u2026"
      startTime: 0
      duration: 2
    - text: was, I guess, haha.
      startTime: 2
      duration: 3
    - text: It started three or four months ago.
      startTime: 5
      duration: 3
    - text: I took the wrong bus and got off in the rain.
      startTime: 8
      duration: 3
    - text: Came in the cafe to escape.
      startTime: 12
      duration: 2
    - text: There was a newspaper on the table.
      startTime: 14.5
      duration: 2.5
    - text: Half of a crossword was already done.
      startTime: 17
      duration: 3
    - text: "I told myself I\u2019d just do one clue."
      startTime: 19
      duration: 4
    - text: "Maria walked past, and said, \u201CYou missed one.\u201D"
      startTime: 24
      duration: 4
    - text: After that, I started coming back.
      startTime: 29
      duration: 2
    - text: When she sees me, she leaves a newspaper out.
      startTime: 31.5
      duration: 3
    frenchClipToListenFor: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 15f7f712013c7f94e955424fd9b66080, type: 3}
    frenchSubtitleChunks:
    - text: "\xC7a, c'est \xE0 moi ou..."
      startTime: 0
      duration: 2
    - text: "ce l'\xE9tait, j'imagine, haha."
      startTime: 2
      duration: 3
    - text: "\xC7a a commenc\xE9 il y a trois ou quatre mois."
      startTime: 5
      duration: 3
    - text: "Je me suis tromp\xE9 de bus et je suis descendu sous la pluie."
      startTime: 8
      duration: 4
    - text: "Je suis entr\xE9 dans le caf\xE9 pour m'abriter."
      startTime: 12
      duration: 2
    - text: Il y avait un journal sur la table.
      startTime: 16
      duration: 2.5
    - text: "Des mots crois\xE9s d\xE9j\xE0 \xE0 moiti\xE9 faits."
      startTime: 17
      duration: 3
    - text: "Je me suis dit que j'allais juste trouver une seule r\xE9ponse."
      startTime: 21
      duration: 4
    - text: "Sonia est pass\xE9e \xE0 c\xF4t\xE9 de moi et a dit : \xAB Vous en avez
        rat\xE9 une. \xBB"
      startTime: 25
      duration: 4
    - text: "Apr\xE8s \xE7a, j'ai commenc\xE9 \xE0 revenir."
      startTime: 30
      duration: 3
    - text: "D\xE8s qu'elle me voit, elle me laisse un journal de c\xF4t\xE9."
      startTime: 33
      duration: 3
    - text: Au fil du temps le crayon a raccourci.
      startTime: 37
      duration: 2.5
    - text: "Et puis un jour, je suis entr\xE9, et il \xE9tait pos\xE9 sur l'\xE9tag\xE8re."
      startTime: 39.5
      duration: 4.5
    - text: Je n'ai pas eu besoin de demander pourquoi.
      startTime: 44
      duration: 4
  - subtitleName: PostIt
    clipToListenFor: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 222fca3698d2bcd498bcb453ea0b6ad8, type: 3}
    subtitleChunks:
    - text: Oh, I am not selling the objects.
      startTime: 0
      duration: 3
    - text: I am closing next week for good and I can't take it all with me...
      startTime: 3
      duration: 4
    - text: so I'm giving them to everyone.
      startTime: 7.5
      duration: 3
    frenchClipToListenFor: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c165f14422f1cb241a893309549d5769, type: 3}
    frenchSubtitleChunks:
    - text: Oh, je ne vends pas ces objets.
      startTime: 0
      duration: 3
    - text: "Je ferme d\xE9finitivement la semaine prochaine et je ne peux pas tout
        emporter avec moi..."
      startTime: 3
      duration: 5.5
    - text: "alors je les offre \xE0 tout le monde."
      startTime: 8.5
      duration: 3
  - subtitleName: Goodbye
    clipToListenFor: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b24b3e84e76c37b469733833c3debcad, type: 3}
    subtitleChunks:
    - text: Was nice meeting you.
      startTime: 0
      duration: 2
    - text: Will I see you on Friday? We're doing one last celebration!
      startTime: 2
      duration: 5
    frenchClipToListenFor: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e1873316f8952e74fbe4be2064d3d8ff, type: 3}
    frenchSubtitleChunks:
    - text: "C'\xE9tait un plaisir de vous rencontrer."
      startTime: 0
      duration: 2
    - text: "On se voit vendredi ? On fait une toute derni\xE8re f\xEAte !"
      startTime: 2
      duration: 5.5
  initialLanguage: 1
