  inspectionAudio: {fileID: 0}
  cardName: MR. GNOME
  cardFromWhom: Walter (61)
  cardMainDescription: "He ran away from Walter\u2019s front yard to stake out the
    caf\xE9 counter. Now he spends every morning scanning the espresso line, desperately
    hoping his Ms. Right will order a Vanilla Late."
  cardNameFrench: Monsieur Gnome
  cardFromWhomFrench: Walter (61)
  cardMainDescriptionFrench: "Il s\u2019est \xE9chapp\xE9 du jardin de Walter. Depuis,
    il passe chaque matin \xE0 scruter la file d\u2019attente pour l\u2019espresso,
    esp\xE9rant d\xE9sesp\xE9r\xE9ment que la femme de ses r\xEAves vienne commander
    un latte \xE0 la vanille."
