  cardName: The Guardians
  cardFromWhom: Mirella (27)
  cardMainDescription: "Mirella brought these two along to keep Sonia\u2019s indoor
    garden company. They\u2019ve been quietly keeping watch ever since, making sure
    everything stays green, peaceful, and slightly mysterious."
  cardNameFrench: Les gardiens
  cardFromWhomFrench: Tilda (27)
  cardMainDescriptionFrench: "Tilda les a apport\xE9s pour tenir compagnie au jardin
    d\u2019int\xE9rieur de Sonia. Depuis, ils montent tranquillement la garde, veillant
    \xE0 ce que tout reste bien vert, paisible et l\xE9g\xE8rement myst\xE9rieux."
