  cameraLocalOffset: {x: 0.1, y: 0, z: 0.8}
  inspectionAudio: {fileID: 0}
  cardName: Perot in a Shoe
  cardFromWhom: Thomas
  cardMainDescription: Thomas, who gifted Perot to Sonia, is a firm believer that
    Crocs are the ultimate form of comfort. So when he found a spare Croc, he decided
    Perot deserved to experience the same luxury. Perot has been sitting there ever
    since, looking weirdly pleased with his new home.
  cardNameFrench: Perot dans croc
  cardFromWhomFrench: Thomas
  cardMainDescriptionFrench: "Thomas, qui a offert Perot \xE0 Sonia, est convaincu
    que les Crocs sont le summum du confort. Alors, quand il a trouv\xE9 un Croc
    de rechange, il a d\xE9cid\xE9 que Perot m\xE9ritait de profiter du m\xEAme luxe.
    Depuis, Perot est assis l\xE0, l'air \xE9trangement satisfait de sa nouvelle
    maison."
  idCardPanel: {fileID: 1759364545}
  nameTextUI: {fileID: 1853782753}
