  cardName: Mara the Monstera
  cardFromWhom: Sonia
  cardMainDescription: "Sonia started bringing plants into the caf\xE9 from the very
    beginning. One became two, two became 22, and soon there was something green
    in every corner."
  cardNameFrench: Mara la Monstera
  cardFromWhomFrench: Sonia
  cardMainDescriptionFrench: "Sonia a commenc\xE9 \xE0 apporter des plantes au caf\xE9
    d\xE8s le d\xE9but. Une est devenue deux, deux sont devenues 22, et bient\xF4t,
    il y avait une touche de verdure dans chaque recoin."
